        "original_id": "2796d3e1-6e48-5bf4-979c-90392e934574",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Il-hyung\n- Films: A Violent Prosecutor, The Moonlight of Seoul, My Way\n- Companies: Showbox\n- Roles: Assistant director, Director\n- Places: South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, Lee Il-hyung worked as an assistant director on the film The Moonlight of Seoul.\n- In 2011, Lee Il-hyung worked as an assistant director on the film My Way.\n- Before directing his first feature film, Lee Il-hyung also worked as an assistant director on commercial films.\n- A Violent Prosecutor was Lee Il-hyung's first feature film as a director.\n- A Violent Prosecutor was released in South Korea on February 3, 2016.\n- Showbox distributed A Violent Prosecutor in South Korea.",
